# First run (kept as evidence, not edited): CI run 37853604176, job 113572379702 (k3-cleanup-17), commit 9112f3ed.
# 15 of 17 cases PASS: 9 Native, 4 races (two ticks one log, busy table retried, a real pg_cron job fired and cleaned,
# nightly backup restore-verified over 556 tables), 2 HTTP. The two browser cases stopped: after the reload the script
# clicked "Buka hasil analisis bertahap terakhir", but opening the panel already reopens the last finished result by
# itself (src/NativeAnalysisPanel.tsx mount effect), so the button was disabled while that reopen ran and then left the
# page when the result was shown. Cause: a test-script defect, not the product. (The K2 browser journey clicks the same
# button and passes because there the automatic reopen meets an expired result and the button stays.) Fix: the script
# waits for the result the panel reopens by itself, then asserts the button is gone and keeps every other check
# (same identity hash and page count, no request or step, kept-until label, plan options after cleanup). No product code
# changed. The probe's final line below is the generic T3 gate refusing an INCOMPLETE suite.
